# Run Matrix Rain when done with tasks

Whenever you finish tasks in this project (whether or not you changed code):

1. **Kill** any running Matrix Rain process (python or pythonw):
   ```powershell
   Get-CimInstance Win32_Process | Where-Object { $_.CommandLine -like '*matrix_rain*' } | ForEach-Object { Stop-Process -Id $_.ProcessId -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue }
   ```

2. **Start** a new instance (no console, tray only):
   ```powershell
   Start-Process pythonw -ArgumentList "run_matrix_rain.pyw" -WorkingDirectory "X:\MyApps\MatrixRain"
   ```

Do this as the last step before replying so the app is running for the user.
